<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan central bank takes 1.3 bln rupees in OMO.</title>
<headline>Pakistan central bank takes 1.3 bln rupees in OMO.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank said on Wednesday it had accepted 1.3 billion rupees in Short Term Federal Bonds in an open market operation.</p>
<p>Figures in brackets show results of the last OMO on September 18.</p>
<p>				Offered    Accepted    Max cut-off</p>
<p> Outright sales	1,700 (50) 1,300 (50) 15.10 pct/yr (13.50)</p>
<p> Five-month REPO	   nil	  nil	    nil</p>
<p> Three-month REPO	  nil	  nil	    nil</p>
<p> One-month REPO	    nil	  nil	    nil</p>
<p> Total (million rupees)     1,700	1,300</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
